!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Start the process by identifying the vacancy;
:v1: Is there a suitable candidate available initially ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "No"])
:Advertise the vacancy;
:v2: Is there a suitable candidate available after advertising ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = "No"])
:Advertise the vacancy again;
else ([v2 = "Yes"])
->;
endif
else ([v1 = "Yes"])
->;
endif
:Select the appropriate applicant;
:Candidate is appointed;
stop
